   "learned": [
    {
     "en": "Suklenmung became king in 1539",
     "as": "চুক্লেনমুং ১৫৩৯ চনত ৰজা হয়"
    },
    {
     "en": "He made Garhgaon the capital (about 1540)",
     "as": "তেওঁ গড়গাঁও ৰাজধানী কৰে (প্ৰায় ১৫৪০)"
    },
    {
     "en": "So he is called the Garhgayan Roja",
     "as": "সেয়ে তেওঁক গড়গঞা ৰজা বোলা হয়"
    },
    {
     "en": "He built the Naga Ali and dug the Garhgaon tank",
     "as": "তেওঁ নগা আলি বান্ধে আৰু গড়গাঁৱৰ পুখুৰী খান্দে"
    }
   ],
   "steps": [
    {
     "type": "story",
     "img": "suklenmung/accession.webp",
     "title": {
      "en": "A son on the throne",
      "as": "সিংহাসনত পুত্ৰ"
     },
     "text": [
      {
       "en": "In <mark>1539</mark>, after his father was murdered, [[suklenmung]] became king.",
       "as": "<mark>১৫৩৯</mark> চনত পিতৃৰ হত্যাৰ পিছত [[suklenmung]] ৰজা হয়।"
      },
      {
       "en": "Many suspected him of the murder. To clear his name, he had all the assassin's brothers put to death.",
       "as": "বহুতে তেওঁকে হত্যাৰ বাবে সন্দেহ কৰিছিল। নিজৰ নাম পৰিষ্কাৰ কৰিবলৈ তেওঁ হত্যাকাৰীৰ সকলো ভাইক মৃত্যুদণ্ড দিলে।"
      }
     ],
     "id": "ak4.skl.u1.01"
    },
    {
     "type": "story",
     "img": "suklenmung/building-garhgaon.webp",
     "title": {
      "en": "Garhgaon",
      "as": "গড়গাঁও"
     },
     "text": [
      {
       "en": "Around <mark>1540</mark> he built a new capital at [[garhgaon]], near today's Nazira. People called him the <mark>Garhgayan Roja</mark>.",
       "as": "<mark>১৫৪০</mark> চনৰ আশে-পাশে তেওঁ আজিৰ নাজিৰাৰ ওচৰৰ [[garhgaon]]ত নতুন ৰাজধানী পাতিলে। মানুহে তেওঁক <mark>গড়গঞা ৰজা</mark> বুলিলে।"
      },
      {
       "en": "He had the Garhgaon tank dug, and a road, the [[naga-ali]], built to the Naga hills.",
       "as": "তেওঁ গড়গাঁৱৰ পুখুৰী খন্দালে, আৰু নগা পাহাৰলৈ এটা আলি, [[naga-ali]], বন্ধালে।"
      }
     ],
     "id": "ak4.skl.u1.02"
    },
    {
     "type": "story",
     "art": "scroll",
     "title": {
      "en": "The first coins",
      "as": "প্ৰথম মুদ্ৰা"
     },
     "text": [
      {
       "en": "Suklenmung is said to be the <mark>first Ahom king to strike coins</mark>.",
       "as": "চুক্লেনমুঙক <mark>মুদ্ৰা প্ৰচলন কৰা প্ৰথম আহোম ৰজা</mark> বুলি কোৱা হয়।"
      },
      {
       "en": "The coins were <mark>octagonal</mark> (eight-sided), because an old text described the Ahom country as having that shape. The writing was in the Ahom script.",
       "as": "মুদ্ৰাবোৰ আছিল <mark>অষ্টভুজ</mark> (আঠ কোণীয়া), কাৰণ এখন পুৰণি গ্ৰন্থত আহোম দেশৰ আকৃতি তেনেকুৱা বুলি কোৱা হৈছিল। লিখনি আছিল আহোম লিপিত।"
      }
     ],
     "id": "ak4.skl.u1.07"
    },
